---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "LED / Pixel Shows | Flux Entertainment";
const description = "Synchronised LED & pixel performances from Flux Entertainment — striking, flame-free spectacle for indoor venues, all-ages events, and fire-restricted spaces.";
---
<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <Fragment slot="page-style">
<style is:global>
  .svc-hero{
    position:relative; min-height:60vh; padding-top:140px; padding-bottom:30px; overflow:hidden;
    background:var(--void);
  }
  .svc-hero-video{position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position:center center; z-index:0;}
  .svc-hero-overlay{
    position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:1;
    background:
      linear-gradient(to top, rgba(10,9,8,0.97) 0%, rgba(10,9,8,0.65) 55%, rgba(10,9,8,0.45) 100%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 75% 25%, rgba(140,26,26,0.35) 0%, rgba(10,9,8,0) 65%);
  }
  .svc-hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 5rem); color:var(--bone); max-width:820px;}
  .svc-breadcrumb{color:var(--ash-dim); font-size:0.82rem; margin-bottom:20px;}
  .svc-breadcrumb a{color:var(--ash-dim);}
  .svc-breadcrumb a:hover{color:var(--gold);}

  .svc-photo{
    aspect-ratio:3/4; background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 30% 20%, rgba(214,40,40,0.35), transparent 60%), var(--char-2);
    border:1px solid #2A231F;
  }
  .options-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:0; position:relative; z-index:2; margin-top:26px; max-width:640px;}
  .option-item{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid #29221E; color:var(--ash); font-size:0.98rem;}
  .option-item svg{width:18px; height:18px; color:var(--gold); flex-shrink:0;}

  .photo-row{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:20px; position:relative; z-index:2;}
  .photo-row .svc-photo{aspect-ratio:4/3;}

  .highlight-block{
    border-left:2px solid var(--flame); padding:6px 0 6px 28px; margin-top:50px;
    position:relative; z-index:2;
  }
  .highlight-block p{color:var(--ash); font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.6;}

  .sfx-callout{
    margin-top:50px; border:1px solid #2A231F; padding:32px; display:flex; align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between; gap:24px; flex-wrap:wrap; position:relative; z-index:2;
  }
  .sfx-callout p{color:var(--ash); max-width:560px; font-size:0.98rem;}
  .sfx-callout p strong{color:var(--bone);}

  @media (max-width:860px){
    .options-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .photo-row{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  }
</style>
  </Fragment>
<main id="top">

  <!-- SERVICE HERO -->
  <section class="svc-hero">
    <video class="svc-hero-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline aria-label="Flux Entertainment LED and pixel performance footage">
      <source src="https://videos.fluxentertainment.com.au/led-hero-v2.mp4" type="video/mp4">
    </video>
    <div class="svc-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="mark-bg" style="top:-150px; right:-200px; opacity:0.3; z-index:1;"></div>
    <div class="wrap" style="position:relative; z-index:2;">
      <div class="svc-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/#services">Entertainment</a> / LED / Pixel Shows</div>
      <span class="mono eyebrow">Entertainment</span>
      <h1 style="margin-top:18px;">LED / Pixel Shows</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub" style="margin-top:22px;">Synchronised light and pixel performance — a striking, modern alternative to fire and pyrotechnics, built for maximum visual impact.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Book Now</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STORY -->
  <section class="about" style="padding-top:40px; padding-bottom:50px;">
    <div class="mark-bg" style="top:10%; left:-350px; opacity:0.25;"></div>
    <div class="wrap about-grid">
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p>LED and pixel performances bring a striking, futuristic energy to any event — precisely synchronised light, colour and choreography that reads just as powerfully indoors as it does under the night sky.</p>
        <p>Our LED performers work across a range of high-quality, programmable pixel props and disciplines — from illuminated staffs to hoops — creating fluid, hypnotic visuals that can be programmed to match your event's colours, branding or music.</p>
        <p>Unlike fire, LED and pixel shows carry no naked flame, making them ideal for indoor venues, all-ages events and spaces where fire restrictions apply — without compromising on scale or visual impact.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-ghost" style="display:inline-block; margin-top:10px;">Enquire About This Show</a>
      </div>
      <div class="svc-photo" style="overflow:hidden;">
        <video autoplay muted loop playsinline aria-label="Flux Entertainment LED performer close-up" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover;">
          <source src="https://videos.fluxentertainment.com.au/led-paragraph-video.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- AVAILABLE OPTIONS -->
  <section class="provide" style="padding-top:60px; background:
      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(10,9,8,0.6) 0%, rgba(10,9,8,0.92) 70%, var(--void) 100%),
      url('/images/eda409fbe4b63c69.jpg');
      background-size:cover; background-position:center; background-repeat:no-repeat;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="mono eyebrow">What's Included</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top:18px;">Available Options</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="options-grid">
        <div class="option-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Solo feature LED/pixel shows</div>
        <div class="option-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Duo feature LED/pixel shows</div>
        <div class="option-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Large group feature LED/pixel shows</div>
        <div class="option-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Customisable colours &amp; branding</div>
        <div class="option-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>LED roving performers</div>
        <div class="option-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Hybrid pairing with fire or pyrotechnics</div>
        <div class="option-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Suitable for indoor and outdoor environments</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PHOTO ROW -->
  <section class="services" style="padding-top:70px; padding-bottom:70px; background:
      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(10,9,8,0.55) 0%, rgba(23,19,16,0.9) 60%, var(--char) 100%),
      url('/images/bbb590016dcc53a5.jpg');
      background-size:cover; background-position:center; background-repeat:no-repeat;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="photo-row">
        <div class="svc-photo" style="overflow:hidden;"><img src="/images/2f174dd927eb8c31.jpg" alt="Flux Entertainment LED performers with light staffs" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position:top;"></div>
        <div class="svc-photo" style="overflow:hidden;"><img src="/images/38361b092f85a684.jpg" alt="Flux Entertainment LED staff performers forming a light arc" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover;"></div>
        <div class="svc-photo" style="overflow:hidden;"><img src="/images/ad7afe8f4af24b31.jpg" alt="Flux Entertainment LED hoop performer" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover;"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="highlight-block">
        <p>Flux's LED and pixel shows deliver the same high-impact, tightly choreographed energy the brand is known for — without a single flame. A striking option for venues, weather conditions or event styles where fire isn't the right fit, without ever compromising on scale or spectacle.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sfx-callout">
        <p>Enhance your experience even further with <strong>Flux SFX</strong> — choreographed fireworks, flame effects, and stage effects that elevate any performance into something even more immersive.</p>
        <a href="https://www.fluxsfx.com.au" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-ghost">Explore Flux SFX</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TRUSTED BY -->
  <div class="trust" style="margin-top:0;">
    <div class="trust-label mono">Who We've Worked With</div>
    <div class="marquee-track">
      <div class="logo-box client"><img src="/images/057c0d093231835b.png" alt="ACT Government logo"></div>
